            "review_title": "Review at Minus 1 Bar",
            "review_text": "Александра С\n10 contributions\n0\nBest bar in Nha Trang\nAug 2025 • Friends\nIf you lived in Nha Trang and didn't visit that bar, that's a huge omission. \nThe soul of this bar is really Gregory's best bartender, who, in his first words, picks out the perfect cocktail for you without a second thought, and hits the spot. He's a walking encyclopedia about bar life, drink formulations, the subtleties of combinations, and he can share it all in a pleasant conversation. \nIt's the aesthetic of preparing, serving, approaching every customer. The bar is definitely for those who are true taste lovers. We certainly recommend a visit.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 26, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
