            "review_title": "Review at Minus 1 Bar",
            "review_text": "Getaway42778769854\n1 contribution\n0\nNumber 1 cocktail bar in Nha Trang\nSep 2024 • Couples\nMinus 1 is leading the cocktail culture of Nha Trang. Grisha is a highly experienced bartender that has created a top quality cocktail menu. All of the cocktails are innovative, well crafted creations. The staff are very friendly and the atmosphere is comfortably chill. This bar is a must do when you are in Nha Trang.\nInsider tip:\nJust relax and enjoy\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 22, 2024",
